Models run by DriftCapture
--------------------------
DriftCapture runs the models below. Their weights are not in this repository
and are not distributed with it: tools/capture-weights/ fetches each at the
revision its manifest pins, verifies it, and converts it, and a game that
ships one ships it under that model's own licence. Each model's definition in
this engine is written from its project's published code.

